{
  "_name": "s03_seattle_medium",
  "_desc": "Seattle-area medium topology (134 repeaters from MeshCore real-sim ITM dataset, lat/lon-driven path loss). 4 companions (alice/bob/carol/dave) at NW/NE/SW/SE corners. Same message_schedule as source but shifted +25000ms past the longer warmup. dual-SF: routing_sf=10 + allowed_data_sfs=[8,9,10]. Bounded beacons (max 200 B) rotate through the routing table over multiple rounds — needed because the full DV table for 100+ nodes does not fit in one LoRa frame.",
